      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/fa8266748abb0f3057ae2e81f9f4fd8dd220fe12",
      "actor": null,
      "commit_id": null,
      "commit_url": null,
      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/fa8266748abb0f3057ae2e81f9f4fd8dd220fe12",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "9cf3847b5cd05deb3b7e1c5909d1ca5790f5c695",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/9cf3847b5cd05deb3b7e1c5909d1ca5790f5c695"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": false,
        "reason": "no_user",
        "payload": "tree 9cf3847b5cd05deb3b7e1c5909d1ca5790f5c695\nparent fa911d815dba280f7d4a1b3fe7b786be37afaf75\nauthor MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1784026125 +0200\ncommitter MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1784025932 +0200\n\nfuzz: Use LIMITED_WHILE over for-loop with consumed size integral\n\nThis is a style cleanup. The general pattern to use `LIMITED_WHILE`,\nwhich all other fuzz tests use, has some benefits:\n\n* When no data is available, a simple and single (let's say) 64 value in\n  the fuzz input will not result in 64 loops over the same body with the\n  same default/fallback values.\n* When no data is available, `ConsumeBool` falls back to `false` and\n  breaks the loop early.\n* When further data is available, the overhead is just a single byte,\n  making it also possibly easier for the fuzz engine to mutate the data,\n  as a single int that influences the whole remainder of the fuzz input\n  can lead to the 'havoc' effect.\n* When a crash is reduced, deleting bytes will directly influence the\n  execution length, so byte-length of the fuzz input roughly corresponds\n  to run-time length.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgqxY/aMPiuXoCFn6iAEyAhvUqFX\njanTudd31Jtt35ct0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQO5Re4yKvyvvvqlhYl+1pcNZkFmPrzhRPxyNbpS+PJHOoOBlkjJPWVaQ/+HL93SSnb\nJzIO7HWKkEK3hCB7rO9QQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"
      },
